"Live from IRSA's all-sky maps (HiPS) via Aladin Lite. Drag to pan, scroll to zoom. Slide the wavelength: cold brown dwarfs appear only at the long end, normal stars fade there. The orange marker is the target; the dashed line is its measured path. This map works for any coordinates you type.": "实时来自 IRSA 的全天图（HiPS），由 Aladin Lite 显示。拖动平移，滚动缩放。滑动波长：冷的褐矮星只在长波端出现，普通恒星在那里会变暗。橙色标记是目标；虚线是它的实测路径。这张图适用于你输入的任何坐标。",
"Matches these coordinates against the outlines of every public JWST imaging frame in NASA’s MAST archive and shows the real pixels.": "将这些坐标与 NASA MAST 档案中每一幅公开 JWST 成像画面的轮廓进行匹配，并显示真实像素。",
