"Meanings as written in each image's FITS header (FLAGS extension). “Bad” flags are the conservative set from the SPHEREx Explanatory Supplement that IRSA's source-discovery tutorial uses. Last column: images with the flag within 3 pixels of the target / at the target pixel.": "含义取自每张图像 FITS 头文件（FLAGS 扩展）中的原文。“坏”标记是 SPHEREx 解释性补充文件中的保守集合，IRSA 的源发现教程也用它。最后一列：标记出现在目标 3 像素内 / 目标像素处的图像数。",
