"03 · Evidence": "03 · 证据",
"KNOWN OBJECT": "已知天体",
"Confidence:": "可信度：",
"high": "高",
"· 3 of 3 key checks support it": "· 3 项关键检查中有 3 项支持",
"242 of 242 SPHEREx measurements flagged (overflow or bloom: the object is too bright for SPHEREx). No reliable SPHEREx spectrum, so we do not show one.": "242 个 SPHEREx 测量值中有 242 个被标记（溢出或光晕扩散：天体对 SPHEREx 来说太亮）。没有可靠的 SPHEREx 光谱，所以我们不显示。",
"measured motion": "实测运动",
"catalogue motion (Gaia DR3)": "星表运动（Gaia DR3）",
"brightness change Aug 2025→Aug 2026": "亮度变化 2025年8月→2026年8月",
"distance (Gaia parallax)": "距离（Gaia 视差）",
"temperature (Gaia estimate)": "温度（Gaia 估计）",
"What this tells us": "这告诉我们什么",
"(worked out from the numbers above)": "（由上面的数字算出）",
"About 91 km/s across the sky": "横越天空的速度约 91 km/s",
"That is 3.1 times the speed of Earth around the Sun. It is sideways speed only: motion toward or away from us does not show in images.": "这是地球绕太阳速度的 3.1 倍。这只是横向速度：朝向或远离我们的运动在图像中看不出来。",
"How: 4.74 × 10.55″/yr ÷ parallax 0.547″": "算法：4.74 × 10.55″/yr ÷ 视差 0.547″",
"Crosses the width of the full Moon in about 170 years": "约 170 年走过满月的宽度",
"A typical star in these images needs more than 100,000 years, which is why this one stands out in a flipbook.": "图像中一颗普通恒星需要 10 万年以上，所以这颗星在翻页图里很显眼。",
"How: 1,800″ ÷ 10.55″/yr": "算法：1,800″ ÷ 10.55″/yr",
"6.0 light-years away: one of the Sun's nearest neighbours": "距离 6.0 光年：太阳最近的邻居之一",
"The light in these images left it about 6.0 years ago.": "这些图像中的光大约在 6.0 年前离开它。",
"How: 3.26 ÷ parallax (″), Gaia DR3": "算法：3.26 ÷ 视差（″），Gaia DR3",
"About 3,100 K at its surface": "表面温度约 3,100 K",
"That is 54% of the Sun's surface temperature (5,772 K), so it glows mostly in infrared light.": "这是太阳表面温度（5,772 K）的 54%，所以它主要发出红外光。",
"How: Gaia DR3 estimate from its colours": "算法：Gaia DR3 根据颜色估计",
"What this view cannot show": "这个视图看不到什么",
"Motion: an object must shift 2 SPHEREx pixels (12″) to count as moving. Over these 16.1 years that means faster than 0.76″ per year. Slower objects read as “no measurable motion”.": "运动：天体必须移动 2 个 SPHEREx 像素（12″）才算在运动。在这 16.1 年里，这意味着速度要大于每年 0.76″。更慢的天体会显示为“无可测运动”。",
"SPHEREx alone covers only 12 months here: by the same 2-pixel rule, enough only for motion faster than 13″ per year. The 2010 WISE image is what makes slower motion visible.": "单靠 SPHEREx 这里只覆盖 12 个月：按同样的 2 像素规则，只够看出每年快于 13″ 的运动。2010 年的 WISE 图像才让更慢的运动变得可见。",
"Brightness: compared at 3 SPHEREx visits only. A change between or outside those dates is not seen.": "亮度：只比较了 3 次 SPHEREx 访问。这些日期之间或之外的变化看不到。",
"Bright stars: this one overflows SPHEREx pixels, so its spectrum and exact brightness are not reliable here.": "亮星：这颗星会使 SPHEREx 像素溢出，所以这里它的光谱和确切亮度不可靠。",
"Solar System: the page checks against Gaia stars only. It does not check asteroids or comets, so a moving dot without a Gaia circle may be a known asteroid.": "太阳系：本页只与 Gaia 恒星比对。不检查小行星或彗星，所以没有 Gaia 圆圈的移动亮点可能是已知小行星。",
"Crowding: one SPHEREx pixel is 6.15″ wide, so two close objects can blend into one dot and one spectrum.": "拥挤：一个 SPHEREx 像素宽 6.15″，所以两个靠得很近的天体可能混成一个点，只得到一条光谱。",
