"Four Kepler stars measured here and the Sun, all at the same 42,000×. Pitch falls as stars get bigger and less dense.": "这里测量的四颗开普勒恒星和太阳，全部以同样的 42,000 倍播放。恒星越大、密度越低，音调越低。",
