"WANDERERS points people at interesting objects and shows the evidence. Confirming a new object needs follow-up by astronomers.": "WANDERERS 带你找到有趣的天体并展示证据。要确认新天体，还需要天文学家的后续观测。",
"Data: SPHEREx DR1 and QR3 (NASA/IPAC IRSA) · AllWISE and NEOWISE (NASA/IPAC IRSA) · Gaia DR3 (ESA) · Webb frames: MAST (STScI) and ESA ESASky · star names: HYG (CC BY-SA 4.0). NASA Space Apps 2026 · Planet X and SPHEREx. WANDERERS is an independent student project and is not affiliated with or endorsed by NASA or ESA.": "数据：SPHEREx DR1 和 QR3 (NASA/IPAC IRSA) · AllWISE 和 NEOWISE (NASA/IPAC IRSA) · Gaia DR3 (ESA) · Webb 图像：MAST (STScI) 和 ESA ESASky · 恒星名称：HYG (CC BY-SA 4.0)。NASA Space Apps 2026 · Planet X and SPHEREx。WANDERERS 是一个独立的学生项目，与 NASA 或 ESA 无关联，也未获其认可。",
