"Through Webb opens the same sky map; choose its Through Webb tab to see any Webb image of this spot. SIMBAD": "“通过 Webb 看”会打开同一张星空图；选它的“通过 Webb 看”标签，可以看到这个位置的任何 Webb 图像。SIMBAD",
"shows whether astronomers already know an object here. Backyard Worlds is the citizen-science project that hunts brown dwarfs in WISE images.": "会显示天文学家是否已经知道这里有个天体。Backyard Worlds 是在 WISE 图像中寻找褐矮星的公民科学项目。",
"Look it up in other archives": "在其他档案中查找",
"It moves, so each link uses the right date: sky viewers open where it should be today (moved with its measured motion), and catalogue searches use its J2000 position (SIMBAD, VizieR) or its 2016.0 position (Gaia DR3), with a radius that covers the uncertainty of that move plus a year of motion. Older images show it earlier along its path, and a few catalogue entries are for their own observing date: the wider SIMBAD search above covers its whole path since 2000.": "它会移动，所以每个链接都用对应的日期：星空查看器会打开它今天应在的位置（按测得的运动推算），星表搜索则用它的 J2000 位置 (SIMBAD, VizieR) 或 2016.0 位置 (Gaia DR3)，搜索半径覆盖这次推算的不确定度再加一年的运动。更早的图像会显示它沿路径更早的位置，少数星表条目对应它们自己的观测日期：上面更宽的 SIMBAD 搜索覆盖了它自 2000 年以来的整条路径。",
"Where it is, year by year": "它逐年所在的位置",
"Straight-line predictions from the NEOWISE motion; the yearly parallax wobble is left out.": "根据 NEOWISE 运动做的直线预测；不包括每年的视差摆动。",
