"Each detector's co-add of a visit is background-subtracted and divided by its own robust noise (median and {0} x MAD); the co-adds are then summed and divided by the square root of their number, so the picture is in units of the noise and no detector dominates. It mixes wavelengths, so motion is still measured at {1} and {2} µm only.": "每个探测器的一次巡天叠加图先扣除背景，再除以它自己的稳健噪声（中位数和 {0} x MAD）；然后把各叠加图相加，再除以其数量的平方根，所以图像以噪声为单位，没有哪个探测器占主导。它混合了多个波长，所以运动仍然只在 {1} 和 {2} µm 测量。",
