"Between {0} and {1} this star moved {2} arcseconds across the sky, about {3} arcseconds per year, which matches Gaia DR{4}'s catalogue speed to within {5} percent. Gaia's parallax puts it only {6} light-years away, so it really is a close, fast-moving neighbour. One caution: it is too bright for SPHEREx, so all {7} SPHEREx measurements are flagged, and its brightness change (-{8} ± {9} mag) did not pass the steadiness check.": "在 {0} 与 {1} 之间，这颗星在天空中移动了 {2} 角秒，约每年 {3} 角秒，与 Gaia DR{4} 星表速度相差在百分之 {5} 以内。Gaia 的视差显示它只有 {6} 光年远，所以它确实是一个近邻，而且运动很快。有一点要注意：它对 SPHEREx 太亮，所以全部 {7} 次 SPHEREx 测量都被标记，它的亮度变化（-{8} ± {9} mag）没通过稳定性检查。",
"Very little could shake this, because the measured speed matches Gaia's to within {0}%. The weak spots are SPHEREx itself. All {1} of its measurements are flagged because the star is too bright for the detector. The −{2} ± {3} magnitude change comes only from the faint outer glow, because the centre of the image is saturated, so I can't call that change real. A bigger mismatch with Gaia would worry me.": "几乎没有什么能动摇这个结果，因为测得速度与 Gaia 相差在 {0}% 以内。薄弱环节在 SPHEREx 本身。它的全部 {1} 次测量都被标记，因为这颗星对探测器太亮。−{2} ± {3} 星等的变化只来自微弱的外围光晕，因为图像中心饱和，所以我不能说这个变化是真的。与 Gaia 差得更多才会让我担心。",
"NEOWISE Aug {0} · {1} µm · saturated (too bright for this camera)": "NEOWISE 8月 {0} · {1} µm · 饱和（对这台相机太亮）",
"WISE photographed this sky in {0} and SPHEREx in {1} and {2}, so together they span about {3} years. Over that time Kapteyn's Star moved {4} arcseconds, about {5} SPHEREx pixels, which is easy to measure. That gives {6} arcseconds per year, matching Gaia's {7}. SPHEREx alone covers only one year, and all {8} of its measurements here are flagged because the star is too bright for it.": "WISE 在 {0} 拍了这片天空，SPHEREx 在 {1} 和 {2} 拍摄，所以两者合起来跨越约 {3} 年。在这段时间里 Kapteyn's Star 移动了 {4} 角秒，约 {5} 个 SPHEREx 像素，很容易测量。这得出每年 {6} 角秒，与 Gaia 的 {7} 一致。SPHEREx 单独只覆盖一年，而且这里它的全部 {8} 次测量都被标记，因为这颗星对它太亮。",
"The search found no pair of dots that looks like a moving object here.": "搜索没有找到看起来像运动天体的亮点对。",
". {0} saturated at the target pixel. {1} have flags within {2} pixels of the target: OVERFLOW ×{3}, TRANSIENT ×{4}, BLOOM ×{5}, SUR_ERROR ×{6}, NONFUNC ×{7}, HALO ×{8}, COLD ×{9}, DICHROIC ×{10}, PERSIST ×{11}. {12} are used in the spectrum. Flag names are the SPHEREx pipeline's (Explanatory Supplement); hover a flag for its meaning.": "。{0} 张在目标像素处饱和。{1} 张在目标 {2} 像素范围内有标志：OVERFLOW ×{3}，TRANSIENT ×{4}，BLOOM ×{5}，SUR_ERROR ×{6}，NONFUNC ×{7}，HALO ×{8}，COLD ×{9}，DICHROIC ×{10}，PERSIST ×{11}。{12} 张用于光谱。标志名称来自 SPHEREx 流水线（Explanatory Supplement）；悬停在标志上可查看含义。",
