"Gaia independently classifies it as a long-period variable (Mira-type pulsating giant) from about {0} years of its own photometry; this agrees with our SPHEREx measurement": "Gaia 根据自己约 {0} 年的测光，独立把它分类为长周期变星（Mira 型脉动巨星）；这与我们的 SPHEREx 测量一致",
